# Narkk's parrots in Booty Bay.
# Sources: items.json / npcs.json (vendor, stock); the world database (no
# stock limit); Forever's client data (ItemSparse prices; every pet item
# teaches its companion when used).

step Narkk
  tip Narkk, the pirate supplier in Booty Bay, sells two parrots (40s each), with no stock limit. He stands next to Kelsey Yance, the cook. Booty Bay is neutral: the boat from Ratchet and the Stranglethorn road both arrive there. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards.
  vendor 2663                         -- Narkk
  buy 8495 npc 2663 optional          -- Parrot Cage (Senegal), 40s
  buy 8496 npc 2663 optional          -- Parrot Cage (Cockatiel), 40s
